<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hakan Çapuk</span>: Trained the model, developed and tested many ideas for types of training/inference, developed the equirectangular-conditioned refinement and super-resolution methods, circular padding, running and testing of baselines, generation of results for our models and ablations, setting up image datasets, tested early captioning ideas.</p>
